      "reasons": [
        "The packet does not support that the purpose of the technique is “to examine whether a person notices both together.”",
        "The packet does not explicitly define double-simultaneous stimulation as “typically one on each side of the body or space,” even though it discusses contralesional vs ipsilesional tactile deficits in unilateral brain-damaged patients.",
        "The packet supports the idea of contralesional tactile reporting deficits and relates them to “extinction,” but it does not explicitly define extinction in the precise terms “where the stimulus on the side opposite the lesion is missed when both are given simultaneously.”"
